# Line endings.
#
# Scripts that run inside Linux containers must keep LF regardless of the
# checkout platform. A CRLF checkout on Windows breaks them at the first line:
# `set -eu\r` fails with "set: illegal option -", which is how
# local/iam-register/register.sh first failed here.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
local/.env text eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.gz binary
